ERR the nuzur model cannot express — triggers, functions, views, sequences, row-level
ERR security, check constraints — is invisible to this diff and is never dropped by it.
ERR Column defaults and foreign key referential actions ARE part of the model and are
ERR reconciled: a default or an ON DELETE/ON UPDATE the model does not state is dropped
ERR from the database like any other column change.[0m
